# When securing assembly with fasteners, use the appropriate (preference)

Standing user preference: When securing assembly with fasteners, use the appropriate wrench; if the exact size is unavailable, use the next size up and apply extra torque.

## Conventions
- When securing assembly with fasteners, use the appropriate wrench; if the exact size is unavailable, use the next size up and apply extra torque.

